          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### Design Rationale Summary:

| Milestone | Rule Type | Why |
|-----------|-----------|-----|
| find_pig | position_near_with_facing | "Find" task = visual observation. Player must be within 8 blocks AND facing the pig pen (60° tolerance). Not trivially satisfied at spawn due to facing requirement. |
| find_gold_ore | position_near_with_facing | "Find" task = visual observation. Player must be within 10 blocks of gold_ore cluster AND facing it. Requires navigating ~7+ blocks from spawn into the cave area. |

### Key Verification Points:
- ✅ Milestones array length (2) matches atomic_tasks_ordered length (2)
- ✅ Task names exactly match: "find a pig", "find gold_ore"
- ✅ milestone_ids are unique: "find_pig", "find_gold_ore"
- ✅ All rules use coordinate_frame="spawn_relative"
- ✅ No position_inside_box used (these are find tasks, not navigation tasks)
- ✅ No min_count=0 anywhere
- ✅ Rules are non-empty arrays
- ✅ Descriptions explain both WHAT is checked and WHY the rule type was chosen

